sequence "<ESC>[" (without the quotes), SS3 is decimal code 143 and can be
replaced by "<ESC>O".  VT1xx terminals don't accept <CSI> and <SS3>.

PF1=<SS3>P PF2=<SS3>Q PF3=<SS3>R PF4=<SS3>S
