   This is simply nonsense.  See the October 1996 original Microprocessor Report
   article on the 21264 at:

      www.chipanalyst.com/q/@6802546ysmwvv/report/articles/21264/21264.html

   In the article it is specifically noted that "Digital projects system shipments
   no sooner than 4Q97".  All the indications are that DEC/Compaq will be shipping
   systems by 4Q98 so you do the math.

