   in 1994 although most of the ground work was independently underway at Intel
   and HP since 1991.  So depending on how you look at it, Merced will either have
   taken 6.5 years or 9+ years to go from concept to shipping systems.  And despite
   these glacial time scales it has still slipped 8 or 9 months and counting.

