Has anyone here *ever* seen an NT PC reporting memory errors?
all the ones i've ever run into w/ memory going bad, just BSOD.

Further still, NT event logs appear a far cry from OVMS's error
logging;   To distingiush between a bad controller, bad disk(s),
or perhaps bad cabling/termination is major guesswork on NT.

NT's Mean Time To Repair sucks.  One winds up replacing
everything;  and i do mean *Everything*.








