Apples and oranges.  VAX memory is usually ECC, not so PC memory.  If you
compare Alpha *workstation* memory to PC memory, the cost is the same, as
the chips are the same.  Alpha servers still tend to use ECC memory, but
there we have apples vs. apples, since the boxes will run both OS's,  and
the memory price is the same for both. 

