D.Webb wrote:
> Difficult to see how they could be developing a 64bit version of NT on
> anything other than Alpha at present - and having developed it on Alpha
> what on earth would stop them selling it on Alpha ?

When Win95 was released, Microsoft would not release the french version of
Win95 (which was ready) until it was also released in Europe. Prices in Canada
would match that of the english version, but in Europe, WIN-95 would be much
more expensive and MS did not want european retailers to come to canada to buy
the french version of '95 at a retail cost less than the wholesale cost in Europe.

Our government got involved and MS did release the french version at the same
