  MicroVAX 3400 KA640 CPU, enclosure and power supplies, MS650 series
  memory, optional Q-bus disk controller (RQDX3, UDA50, etc),
  optional Q-bus tape controller (TQK70, etc), serial controller,
  random other Q-bus widgets.

