My guess is then that your NT4 server is NOT configured to write this
information into the log file.  Log on to the NT4 server and do the
following:

    1. Right-click on "My Computer"  (LOL - shouldn't that be "My Server"?)
    2. Select "Properties" from the menu
    3. Select the "Startup/Shutdown" tab

The entries in the "Recovery" section should be self-explanatory.  At the
very least, you want to select "Write error to system log" and perhaps
"Automatically reboot"


