overdue)?  I don't know anything about what may be causing YOUR crashes, but
I went through a similar experience with one of my NT servers a few months
ago, and it turned out that someone was using a Teardrop attack on it!
Installing the Teardrop2 hotfix cleared up that problem, and the server's
been working quite happily since.

