|> : Well, there was an 11/750 that was running scheduling and monitoring
|> : software for an extremely expensive peice of high-energy physics
|> : equipment.  The box stayed up so long that, so the story goes, DEC
|> : released a software patch to avoid reusing process-id 0 when the
|> : process numbers wrapped.
