I totally agree with both Chris and Mark.

My rational in this case for not using earlier versions of NT is that the
original requester stated he was trying to head off NT coming into their
environment.  That means that he won't be buying NT 3.xx, so using NT 3.xx
as an example is misleading.  On the other hand, if his experience with NT
