techniques can bring down any system -- note the fiasco at both the Denver
International Airport (baggage system delayed DIA for over a year) and the
new Hong Kong airport, where we still don't know what the problem is, but I
suspect some of each.  Sloppy engineering can overcome even the best of
tools.

