business needs first.  Previous commentary acknowledged but was uncertain as
to the reason for the As/400 popularity.  As/400 has over 500,000 installs
representing most popular midrange computer.  We attribute this largely to
what was mentioned in previous commentary, "applications, applications,
applications".	AS/400 has over 25,000 commercial applications, 1000s of
Lotus Domino applications, 1000s of e-business applications, 1000s of NT and
netware applications and numerous unix applications...and they're all 64-bit.
