The 3A is an LN03 (basic) printer. 300 dots per inch. Not capable of a full
page bitmap image.
(The LN03-S is the LN03 PLUS which is capable of full page bitmaps).

8 pages per minute. 

It accepts ASCII (ISO-LATIN-1) with DEC/ANSI escpae sequences with a few additions.

