In article <35A1131E.80584CA7@newark1.newark.ohio-state.edu>, 
march@newark1.newark.ohio-state.edu says...
> Uh-oh, don't forget Easter.  It happens on the first Sunday after the first full
> moon
> on or after the Vernal Equinox:
