The FX-2 systems have the ability to power on and off under software control.
The connections for this go through the front panel controls, the riser card,
the main logic board and the power supply.  I would check to see that all of
these are connected properly.  Try carefully disconnecting and reconnecting
the connections.  This should be done with the power cord disconnected 
though, since otherwise, you could damage something due to the system doing
a power up with the connectors only partially connected.

There is a power controller option available for the FX-2 systems that 
changes the way that the systems power up.  Is one of these installed in this
system?

